{
    "title": "Zipcar",
    "description": "With Zipcar, you have a car in the city, with no strings attached. Join our car-sharing community to skip the costs and hassles of owning a car. Our app puts thousands of professionally maintained cars at your fingertips. And they\u2019re available 24/7 for quick errands, weekend escapes, and every trip in between.\r\n\r\nInstant Access\r\nJoin now and unlock cars near you with our app, 24/7. Most drivers are approved in minutes. No lines. No wait. No paperwork.\r\n\r\nAll the flexibility and convenience\r\nChoose the perfect car for your errand or weekend getaway, from compacts to roomy SUVs. And book it by the hour or day.\r\n\r\nContact-free pickups and returns\r\nFinding and unlocking your reserved car? Fast and easy. The app has step-by-step directions to the Zipcar parking spot. When you're done, just return it to the same spot.\r\n\r\nSave more with gas included\r\nDitch the huge monthly car payments. And with gas, maintenance, and insurance options included, you save up to $1000/month.\r\n\r\n24/7 support & roadside assistance\r\nNeed a hand while you\u2019re on the road? Our dedicated customer support team is available at all hours to help with any questions or emergencies.\r\n\r\nMore sustainable\r\nCar-sharing with Zipcar helps take cars off our roads. Which means fewer emissions. Less congestion. Greener cities. And a world of difference.",
